<title>GERMANY: Germany in contact with partners on forex-Waigel.</title>
<headline>Germany in contact with partners on forex-Waigel.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBERG, Germany 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Finance Minister Theo Waigel said on Tuesday that Germany was in contact with its trading partners regarding foreign exchange matters.</p>
<p>&quot;We are in contact with our partners and that is all I can say,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
